{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121120831261-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121133202\"/><p>貓咪坐於冷氣機觀看街景。(陳俊華攝)</p><p>將軍澳有貓隻在危險位置。今日(21日)早上11時33分，有厚德邨居民報案，指一隻貓咪危坐於德富樓3樓一單位冷氣機上。人員接報到場在樓上單位吊下捕捉網，惟貓咪不為所動坐於冷氣機頂悠然自得觀看街景。人員正設法將貓咪帶回安全位置。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T05:43:49.531895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T04:08:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:18.985586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T05:37:24.146833+00:00","content_hash":"480f4fcf60446c07d8102329fb02e3368eb874b6f001ff1ae71d1c829f27f7e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}